OL,3,GNEWSAScrutiny chief condemns interview
OL,4,Asilence on report
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth leaders in Guernsey have come
OL,7,Funder fire for not holding interviews
OL,8,Fafter the release of a report showing
OL,9,Fnumerous key targets were missed.
OL,11,FHealth and Social Care's (HSC) annual
OL,12,Freport, external found the Medical
OL,13,FSpecialist Group (MSG) - which holds a
OL,14,Fmultimillion-pound contract to provide
OL,15,Fsecondary healthcare - missed 15 out of
OL,16,F22 performance targets.
OL,18,FScrutiny Management Committee President
OL,19,FAndy Sloan said HSC President Deputy
OL,20,FGeorge Oswald "needs to remember he was
OL,21,Felected to represent the public
OL,22,Finterest not producer interest."
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
