OL,3,GNEWSAScrutiny chief condemns interview
OL,4,Asilence on report
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a written statement on the report
OL,7,FHSC President Deputy George Oswald
OL,8,Fsaid: "High waiting times remain an
OL,9,Fissue and reducing them remains a
OL,10,Fpriority for us."
